{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2023-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1697414400, "end_date": 1698105599, "month_true_total": 59, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:54:08 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "148654233", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026138660", "personaname": "kn0xx", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/grubbguy/", "num_games_owned": 283, "num_reviews": 69, "playtime_forever": 3870, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2907, "last_played": 1719786942, "avatar": "a5d229785794c0d9fb0d4aa315b5124faf3ea777"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you like Kaiju or old monster movies you are gonna love this game.\n\nYou get to use a crazy amount of different weapons from traditional guns and grenades, to bombers, exoskeletons, and giant rocket launchers that fire 20 homing missiles at once, I mean seriously all kinds of insane military gear.\n\nIt has a lot of missions and a local split screen mode which saves progress for both players to player one, making farming upgrades in local really easy and fun.\n\nThe graphics are good, the sound is great, monster designs and the designs of the tanks/vehicles are amazing. The story is very little, it's basically a small text read out before the mission, and then some audio clips of a military person screaming at you but it is definitely enough for some monster-smashing fun.\n\nThe level of destruction possible in this game is nuts as well. You can take down all kinds of buildings, skyscrapers, etc.\n\nIf you like kaiju, big big guns, and co-op play, this one is for you.\n", "timestamp_created": 1697960157, "timestamp_updated": 1697960157, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_releas